{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/aab99720e76dffede527.json":{"assets":{"mn2/gameplay_story_10620020":{"skip":{"source_cn":"依尔兰想寄信给朋友，但送信员一直没来，于是拜托你把信转交给塔兰村的米芮娅。","text_i18n":{"cn":"依尔兰想寄信给朋友，但送信员一直没来，于是拜托你把信转交给塔兰村的米芮娅。","en":"Erlan wishes to send a letter to his friend, but the courier is nowhere to be found. He asks you to help him deliver the message to Miria in Taran Village.","jp":"エルランは友人に手紙を出したいと思っているが、配達員が一向に来ない。そこであなたに、ターラン村のミルリアに宛てた手紙を託した。","kr":"얼란은 친구 마리아에게 편지를 보내고 싶지만, 배달부가 마을에 오질 않는다. 그러자 얼란은 나한테 대신 타란 마을로 편지를 전해달라고 부탁한다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10620020"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22583"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/da3776751676837769db.json":{"assets":{"mn2/gameplay_story_10620030":{"skip":{"source_cn":"收到信的米芮娅又惊又喜，连忙向你道谢。","text_i18n":{"cn":"收到信的米芮娅又惊又喜，连忙向你道谢。","en":"Upon receiving the letter from Erlan, Miria is both surprised and delighted. She thanks you.","jp":"手紙を受け取ったミルリアの顔が驚きと喜びに満ち溢れ、あなたにお礼を言った。","kr":"편지를 받은 마리아는 기뻐하며 나에게 감사 인사를 전했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10620030"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22584"]}}}},"easter_eggs/menus/10030410_1_2.cn.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_10030410:1:2","lang":"cn","texts":{"menu:41715920:1":{"text":"不知道米芮娅有没有危险……","source_cn":"不知道米芮娅有没有危险……","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民依尔兰":{"text":"村民依尔兰","source":"村民依尔兰","status":"exact_hash"}}},"easter_eggs/menus/10030410_1_2.graph.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_10030410:1:2","roots":["menu:41715920:1"],"nodes":{"menu:41715920:1":{"id":"menu:41715920:1","type":"line","entry_kind":"say","source_node_id":"41715920:1","text_key":"menu:41715920:1","speaker_key":"speaker:村民依尔兰","speaker_actor_id":"19","dialogue_frame_type":"Normal","dialogue_frame_type_source":"MenuWorldState via DynamicDialogueAllNode.InitChoiceView","animation_set":"normal","next":"end","speaker_actor_model":